  "demoIntent": {
    "summary": "A mostly healthy organization with two or three teams near the ceiling, a hiring plan that arrives late, and a sequencing conflict the plan does not know about.",
    "intents": [
      "Implementation carries a meaningful gap (8 to 15 FTE at peak) that the planned 10 hires nearly close, five months after the need appears.",
      "Consumer Operations becomes constrained through the seasonal peak as attrition erodes headcount ahead of the planned hires.",
      "Data Platform sits in the 85 to 95% band mid-year: not broken, no slack.",
      "Customer Operations is moderately pressured and is the plausible source team for a reallocation.",
      "International Expansion is planned for March but depends on Platform Scale, which does not finish until November; the engine must show December as the earliest feasible start.",
      "Enterprise Support and Platform Engineering stay healthy so the constraints read as real rather than everything being red."
    ]
  },
